{"id":"n71278-3-7","stage":1,"title":"속 · 内脏","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71278-3-7-1","ko":"얼굴이 안 좋은데 어디 아파?","zh":"你脸色看起来不太好，哪里不舒服吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"脸色","explanation":"얼굴：脸色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"3","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은데","meaning":"好，良好","explanation":"좋다：好，良好；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"4","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아파?","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸色","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"某种心理状态表露于外的表情。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，良好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"身体条件或健康状态等高于一般人。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","ent